    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Well, look, what has happened over the last several weeks has been this somewhat arbitrary hacking and slashing away of core functions of the government, everything from how people get their social security to navigating certainly some of the funding challenges that you outlined. The prime Prime objective here is to build coalition with other members, right? When you come to a legislative body, you do not do everything by yourself. And so what I've done is try to bring a spotlight to various issues and build coalition with my colleagues on both sides of the aisle, Democrats and Republicans. Because we both together have to stand up and say that these cuts, which, you know, again, are not just waste fraud and abuse and whatever claims there are there, because trust me, I think most",
