    "turn_text": "around the country. Have you and your Democratic colleagues been able to speak with your Republican colleagues about, look, I agree with what you said earlier. I think everyone listening is all for reducing and hopefully at some point eliminating government waste. I think that would be a good thing for all of us. But going about it, maybe using a scalpel as opposed to a hatchet, if you know what I mean. In other words, maybe being a little bit more careful about what you cut and when you cut it, as opposed to just saying, we're going to eliminate this and all of this right away. Have you had those conversations with your Republican",
